{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_moonleaf","model_identifier":"trinket_moonleaf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_moonleaf\n\nTrinket, moonleaf.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..2.5, y -10.5..0.0, z -0.6..0.6 (size 5.5 x 10.5 x 1.2 u = 15 x 30 x 3 cm).\nMoonleaf: a crescent shaped like a curled leaf (built of stepped arc pieces with a pale midrib, horns curling toward the model +X side) cradling a faceted green emerald, on a fine chain. Embedded in silver as described; the other metals are trade variants. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: silver. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_moonleaf_copper.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_tin.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_bronze.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_iron.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_steel.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_silver.png`, `trinket_moonleaf_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_moonleaf\n\nTrinket, moonleaf.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..2.5, y -10.5..0.0, z -0.6..0.6 (size 5.5 x 10.5 x 1.2 u = 15 x 30 x 3 cm).\nMoonleaf: a crescent shaped like a curled leaf (built of stepped arc pieces with a pale midrib, horns curling toward the model +X side) cradling a faceted green emerald, on a fine chain. Embedded in silver as described; the other metals are trade variants. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: silver. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant t